<Layout title="Privacy Policy" alternatePath="privacy">

<h1>Privacy Policy — Moja Wioska</h1>

<p><strong>Effective date:</strong> 11 November 2026</p>

<p>This Privacy Policy describes what personal data we collect, how we process it and what rights Users of the "Moja Wioska" application (hereinafter: "App") have.</p>

<h2>1. Data controller</h2>

<p>The controller of personal data processed in the App is the owner of Moja Wioska. For data-protection enquiries please use the contact option in the App's settings.</p>

<h2>2. What data we collect</h2>

<h3>2.1 Data provided during registration</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Email address</strong> — for authentication, account verification and communication.</li>
  <li><strong>Password</strong> — stored in encrypted form in Firebase Authentication.</li>
  <li><strong>Gender</strong> — for personalising outfit recommendations in the weather module.</li>
  <li><strong>Preferred language</strong> (Polish or English) — for displaying the interface in the chosen language.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2.2 Data generated during use</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Tasks</strong> — task content created by the User.</li>
  <li><strong>Recipes</strong> — recipes added manually, imported or generated by AI.</li>
  <li><strong>Shopping list</strong> — products added by the User.</li>
  <li><strong>Notes</strong> — content of pages and sub-pages in the notebook.</li>
  <li><strong>Chat messages</strong> — messages in chat rooms (public and private).</li>
  <li><strong>Quizzes</strong> — topics and results of AI-generated quizzes.</li>
  <li><strong>Outfit ratings</strong> — User feedback on outfit recommendations, used to train the algorithm.</li>
</ul>

<h3>2.3 Data collected automatically</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Device location</strong> — for displaying the weather forecast (with User consent).</li>
  <li><strong>Device token (FCM)</strong> — for sending push notifications.</li>
  <li><strong>Device data</strong> — device type and operating system version (for diagnostics).</li>
</ul>

<h3>2.4 Data processed temporarily</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Photos and PDF files</strong> — uploaded to the document import feature (OCR). Files are processed once and are not stored on the server after reading. Maximum size: 10 MB.</li>
  <li><strong>Camera photos</strong> — used solely for document import; not retained after processing.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. Purposes of data processing</h2>

<p>We process personal data for the following purposes:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Service provision</strong> — registration, login, data synchronisation across devices.</li>
  <li><strong>Personalisation</strong> — outfit recommendations based on gender, weather and rating history.</li>
  <li><strong>AI features</strong> — entity recognition in tasks, recipe and quiz generation, document import (OCR), product categorisation in the shopping list.</li>
  <li><strong>Communication</strong> — push notifications, real-time chat messages.</li>
  <li><strong>Offline mode</strong> — local data storage (IndexedDB) for use without an internet connection.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Legal bases for processing</h2>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Performance of a contract</strong> (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR) — processing necessary to provide the App's services.</li>
  <li><strong>Consent</strong> (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR) — location access, push notifications, photo import.</li>
  <li><strong>Legitimate interest</strong> (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR) — diagnostics, service improvement.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Third-party services</h2>

<p>The App uses the following external services:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Firebase Authentication</strong> (Google LLC) — user authentication (email/password, Google Sign-in).</li>
  <li><strong>Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)</strong> (Google LLC) — push notifications.</li>
  <li><strong>Socket.io</strong> — real-time communication (chat).</li>
</ul>

<p>Each of these services processes data according to its own privacy policy. We encourage you to review Google's privacy policy: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">https://policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

<h2>6. Data retention</h2>

<ul>
  <li>We retain account data and User Content for as long as the User uses the App.</li>
  <li>All data is permanently deleted when the account is deleted.</li>
  <li>Local data (IndexedDB) is stored on the User's device and can be removed by clearing the App's data.</li>
  <li>Files uploaded for document import are not retained after processing.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Data security</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Passwords are stored in encrypted form (Firebase Authentication).</li>
  <li>Communication with the server uses encrypted connections (HTTPS/WSS).</li>
  <li>We apply industry-standard security measures to protect data against unauthorised access.</li>
</ul>

<h2>8. User rights</h2>

<p>Under the GDPR, Users have the following rights:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Right of access</strong> — you may request information about your personal data.</li>
  <li><strong>Right to rectification</strong> — you may correct inaccurate data.</li>
  <li><strong>Right to erasure</strong> — you may delete your account and all associated data.</li>
  <li><strong>Right to restriction of processing</strong> — you may restrict how we process your data.</li>
  <li><strong>Right to data portability</strong> — you may request a machine-readable copy of your data.</li>
  <li><strong>Right to withdraw consent</strong> — you may withdraw consent at any time (e.g. location, notifications).</li>
  <li><strong>Right to lodge a complaint</strong> — you may lodge a complaint with the President of the Polish Personal Data Protection Office (UODO).</li>
</ul>

<h2>9. Children's data</h2>

<p>The App is not directed at children under 16. We do not knowingly collect personal data from anyone under that age. If you learn that a child is using the App without parental consent, please contact us.</p>

<h2>10. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>We will notify Users of material changes to this Privacy Policy through the App. Continued use of the App after changes have been introduced constitutes acceptance.</p>

</Layout>
